# Gitignored files a new worktree needs, copied from the main checkout. Claude Code reads
# this when it creates a worktree; `bin/worktree setup` copies the same files for worktrees
# made any other way. Plain paths and globs only.
#
# config/database.yml is deliberately absent: `bin/worktree config` generates it from
# config/database.yml.sample, so a worktree doesn't inherit a drifted local copy.
.env
.bundle/config
config/credentials/development.key
config/credentials/test.key
config/credentials/e2e.key
dockerfiles/*.secret
